[grammar(u,'三07','不知道 / 想问 + 疑问分句','Retrieve indirect questions without asserting an answer','我不知道她指谁 embeds the unknown reference. It does not assert that she refers to a specific person. Unlike a direct question, an indirect unknown can occur inside a statement; do not add 吗 mechanically.',[('我不知道她指谁。','I do not know whom she refers to.'),('我想问这个模型是谁造的。','I want to ask who made this model.'),('她还没说什么时候转变的。','She has not said when the change happened.')],('我不知道她指谁，所以一定指老师。','我不知道她指谁，还要问。','An unknown reference does not identify someone.')),
grammar(u,'三48','看得懂 / 看不懂：字幕再应用','Retrieve potential understanding','这句看得懂 indicates potential understanding of that sentence, not a claim about every line. 看不清 concerns visual clarity; 看不懂 concerns meaning. A replay may improve clarity without guaranteeing understanding.',[('这句看得懂，下一句还不懂。','I understand this sentence, but not the next.'),('字太小，我看不清。','The text is too small to see clearly.'),('声音调低了，这句还听得清。','The sound is lowered but this sentence is still audible clearly.')],('听得清就一定全部懂。','听得清还不一定理解全部意思。','Audibility and meaning differ.'))],
