[grammar(u,'三49','V得 + 程度：歌词中再用','Retrieve degree in an imagined scene','唱得慢 describes delivery; 哭得很伤心 describes an acted or imagined emotional degree. A lyrical speaker need not be the writer. Distinguish imagery, performance and actual biography.',[('她唱得很慢。','She sings slowly.'),('角色哭得很伤心。','The character cries sadly.'),('这一句读得很清楚。','This sentence is read clearly.')],('歌词里的角色哭，作者一定在哭。','歌词里的角色不一定是作者。','Do not infer biography from a lyrical speaker.')),
grammar(u,'三58','比起…，更…：再次比较','Retrieve the stated comparison basis','比起昨天，这一句更清楚 compares the specific sentence and times. 比起快，她更重视准确 compares priorities, not a universal speed rule. Name a comparison basis and preserve the claim’s scope.',[('比起昨天，这一句更清楚。','Compared with yesterday, this sentence is clearer.'),('比起快，她更重视准确。','She values accuracy more than speed.'),('比起独自练，她更喜欢一起读。','She prefers reading together to practising alone.')],('这句更清楚说明全部都懂了。','这句更清楚没有说明全部都懂。','A comparative clarity claim is not total mastery.'))],
('Whose voice is in the verse?','Read the performance discussion.',[('把两段合起来，按顺序排；重读时别丢意思。','Combine the two passages and arrange them; preserve meaning on rereading.'),('她唱得很慢，是作者也很伤心吗？','She sings slowly. Is the author sad too?'),('不一定，角色和作者不同。比起快，她更重视准确。','Not necessarily; character and writer differ. She values accuracy above speed.'),('划船、烟和武器都是意象，外交和平是愿望吗？','Are rowing, smoke and weapons imagery, and diplomatic peace a wish?'),('这里是原创诗的想象，不是现实报道；直到最后才说清楚。','This is an original verse’s imagination, not a real report; it becomes clear only at the end.'),('好，随自己的节奏读，累了先停止。','Good; read at your own pace and stop first when tired.')],[('detail','What does she prioritize?',['Accuracy','Speed alone','Being first'],0),('inference','Is lyrical emotion necessarily the writer’s?',['No','Yes','Only with smoke'],0)],[],True),
('Read the words and the image','Read the rehearsal note.',[('语言团把两段组合练习，团结不是每个人都同一种感受。','The language group practises joined passages; unity does not mean identical feelings.'),('节拍带动跟读，管材料的人不代任何人同意；推广以前核对来源。','The beat prompts reading along; the materials manager does not consent for others; check sources before promotion.'),('故事里角色前进，追着影子，争第一也要尊重别人，争取机会不等于得到。','The character moves forward and chases shadows; competing for first requires respect; striving is not obtaining.'),('桌上有汤、果汁、香蕉和苹果，旁边的龙玩具只是道具。','The table has soup, juice, bananas and apples; the dragon toy nearby is only a prop.'),('伟大是评价，和平是愿望；直到最后才回答，不说明从最后才开始等。','Great is an evaluation and peace a wish; answering only at the end does not mean waiting starts there.')],[('mainidea','What is the note doing?',['Separating performance, objects and actual claims','Certifying every imagined event','Inferring a writer’s feelings'],0)],[(1,'带动')],False),
('A small original chorus','Read an original verse.',[('船随想象，字随声音。','A boat follows imagination; words follow sound.'),('烟在纸上，不在眼前。','Smoke is on paper, not before our eyes.'),('和平是愿望，回答要等。','Peace is a wish; an answer needs waiting.'),('慢慢前进，意思别丢。','Move forward slowly; preserve meaning.')],[('inference','Where is the smoke placed?',['In the written image','Verified in the room','Inside a real boat'],0)],[],False),
